    {
      "id": "u_1b244350132dc11691dcceee_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To provide frontend logs, we need to open the Developer Console. Often the easiest way is to press __TRILIUM_PH_0__Ctrl__TRILIUM_PH_1__-__TRILIUM_PH_2__Shift__TRILIUM_PH_3__-__TRILIUM_PH_4__I__TRILIUM_PH_5__ which should work in most browsers (and desktop app). Make sure that the error producing action happened right before you copy&paste the errors, the console is cleared on app restart.",
      "sourceHash": "1b244350132dc11691dcceeea47779b1d704e0a9f1ec4132290f66d5d2df54c8",
      "context": "Frontend logs",
      "contextHash": "fcfa44e1f436984e5032a74517a6ea2d84c3ccd9d2bea3682bd64fae2e4309e4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f018797ea1e1fa38ba8cb68c_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "If that doesn't work, then:",
      "sourceHash": "f018797ea1e1fa38ba8cb68c5cb985b877da70f9d90e4392eb92b2c3f864c450",
      "context": "Frontend logs",
      "contextHash": "fcfa44e1f436984e5032a74517a6ea2d84c3ccd9d2bea3682bd64fae2e4309e4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_631ae45ac93708a495d0d3ef_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "in Trilium desktop app, go to top-left menu button -> Advanced -> Developer tools",
      "sourceHash": "631ae45ac93708a495d0d3ef4f6e38b34637050c7a556392272146e58ac99e85",
      "context": "Frontend logs",
      "contextHash": "fcfa44e1f436984e5032a74517a6ea2d84c3ccd9d2bea3682bd64fae2e4309e4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c41b282daa12063130132036_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "In Firefox/Chrome right-click anywhere in the page and click Inspect:",
      "sourceHash": "c41b282daa1206313013203605f446835e805c15c02a87b6c479e652d3696828",
      "context": "Frontend logs",
      "contextHash": "fcfa44e1f436984e5032a74517a6ea2d84c3ccd9d2bea3682bd64fae2e4309e4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b1cb84fb9dbfffb2e76e6356_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Once you have Dev Tools open, click on \"Console\" tab:",
      "sourceHash": "b1cb84fb9dbfffb2e76e63560c99fa89c5c57e4f08be22672f6773abb0b569a1",
      "context": "Frontend logs",
      "contextHash": "fcfa44e1f436984e5032a74517a6ea2d84c3ccd9d2bea3682bd64fae2e4309e4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cc72f9372c366a5676582570_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Copy-paste (or screenshot) the logs. It's better to provide not just errors, but the whole log, which might provide context while analyzing the bug.",
      "sourceHash": "cc72f9372c366a567658257087ed2d165a4c1bda37652ac258fc77134f142b03",
      "context": "Frontend logs",
      "contextHash": "fcfa44e1f436984e5032a74517a6ea2d84c3ccd9d2bea3682bd64fae2e4309e4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
